# Manual reads against an already approved development environment.
# Start no host from this file. Review ../WALKTHROUGH.md first.
@web = https://localhost:7104
# Choose a future date; this is example input, not a captured reservation.
@checkInDate = 2030-01-15

### Server-rendered home page.
GET {{web}}/
Accept: text/html

### Equivalent read of the availability action; the browser UI uses POST.
GET {{web}}/Home/GetVillasByDate?checkInDate={{checkInDate}}&nights=2
Accept: text/html

### Customer login form only; no credentials or account writes.
GET {{web}}/Account/Login
Accept: text/html
